; frostfang_reach.aerie_ascent   centre (95.0, -2235.0)   210 x 170   x -10..200  z -2320..-2150
; THE AERIE ASCENT — the last climb from the head of the glacier to the massif, under the
; northern wall. High traverse with nothing on it.

